{"kiki|Hi mummy Prathyu! I'm Kiki! Can I fly with you?": "vo_00.mp3", "kiki|Yay, more fun together! 💖": "vo_01.mp3", "kiki|Wheee! This is so fun, mummy!": "vo_02.mp3", "kiki|I love our colours, mummy Prathyu!": "vo_03.mp3", "kiki|Bye-bye mummy! See you soon!": "vo_04.mp3", "kiki|Hi mummy Prathyu!": "vo_05.mp3", "prathyu|Hello Kiki! We are both mermaids now!": "vo_06.mp3", "prathyu|Hello Kiki! Stay close to mummy!": "vo_07.mp3", "prathyu|Bye Kiki! Mummy loves you!": "vo_08.mp3", "prathyu|That is Mercury, the tiniest planet and the closest to the Sun. It zooms around the Sun in just eighty eight days!": "vo_09.mp3", "prathyu|Venus is the hottest planet, wrapped in thick yellow clouds. And it spins the wrong way round!": "vo_10.mp3", "prathyu|Look, Kiki, that is Earth, our home! The blue is water, and the little grey friend is our Moon.": "vo_11.mp3", "prathyu|Mars is the red planet. It is rusty and dusty, and it has the tallest volcano of all!": "vo_12.mp3", "prathyu|Jupiter is the giant! It is so big that all the other planets could fit inside it. It has a great big storm too.": "vo_13.mp3", "prathyu|Saturn has beautiful rings made of ice and rocks. It is so light it could float in water!": "vo_14.mp3", "prathyu|Uranus is icy blue and rolls around on its side, like a ball!": "vo_15.mp3", "prathyu|Neptune is deep blue and very windy. It is the farthest planet from the Sun.": "vo_16.mp3", "prathyu|We are underwater now, Kiki! Fish, turtles and whales live in the lake. Swim through the glowing bubbles!": "vo_17.mp3", "prathyu|Back on land! See the flowers and the trees? Butterflies love meadows like this.": "vo_18.mp3", "prathyu|Now we fly above the clouds and into space! Let me tell you about the planets as we pass them.": "vo_19.mp3", "angel|Welcome to Heaven, little unicorn! ✨": "vo_20.mp3", "angel|Goodbye, brave flyer! Come back soon 💫": "vo_21.mp3"}